---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page title="Contact">
  <p class="about-bio">
    음악을 전공한 실용적 빌더.<br />지금은 C++를 학습하며 UE5, Flutter, Python으로 필요한 걸 만들고
    있습니다.
  </p>
  <p class="about-tagline">Need, Learn and Build.</p>

  <hr />

  <p>📧 support@logstone.net</p>
  <p>
    ▶️
    <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@kimlog0415" target="_blank">YouTube @kimlog0415</a>
  </p>

  <hr />

  <h2>Support</h2>
  <p>이 블로그가 도움이 됐다면 커피 한 잔 사주세요 ☕</p>

  <div class="support-buttons">
    <a
      href="https://www.paypal.com/ncp/payment/RJZFK9X53AD4G"
      target="_blank"
      class="support-btn"
    >
      🩵 PayPal
    </a>
    <button class="support-btn" id="kakao-btn">💛 카카오페이</button>
  </div>

  <div class="kakao-qr-modal" id="kakao-qr-modal" hidden>
    <div class="kakao-qr-box">
      <p>카카오페이 앱으로 스캔해주세요</p>
      <img src="/assets/images/kakaopay-qr.png" alt="KakaoPay QR" width="180" />
      <button class="kakao-qr-close" id="kakao-qr-close">닫기</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</Page>

<script>
  const btn = document.getElementById('kakao-btn');
  const modal = document.getElementById('kakao-qr-modal') as HTMLElement | null;
  const closeBtn = document.getElementById('kakao-qr-close');
  const isMobile = /Android|iPhone|iPad|iPod/i.test(navigator.userAgent);

  btn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (isMobile) {
      window.location.href = 'https://qr.kakaopay.com/Ej9NoO4uc';
    } else if (modal) {
      modal.hidden = false;
    }
  });
  closeBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (modal) modal.hidden = true;
  });
  modal?.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
    if (e.target === modal) modal.hidden = true;
  });
</script>
